%F A402476 G.f.: Sum_{k>=1} Product_{j=1..k} x^j/((1 - x^(4*j))*(1 - x^(4*j-1))*(1 - x^(4*j-2))*(1 - x^(4*j-3))).
%F A402476 a(n) ~ c * d^sqrt(n) / n^(3/4), where d = 10.48622034567276064758161... and c = 0.1395513911865819757829...
%t A402476 nmax = 60; CoefficientList[Series[Sum[x^(k*(k+1)/2)/Product[1-x^j, {j, 1, 4*k}], {k, 1, Sqrt[2*nmax]}], {x, 0, nmax}], x]
